      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "密猟者から逃げようとしていた時、\n茂みの奥から今度はルイシャさんが飛び出してきた。",
      "jp_sha256": "0a4cf109c67a41e7823221dcaec698de18ea3be79d8c57b633e2d5495a9313bb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "밀렵꾼에게서 달아나려던 순간,\n이번에는 수풀 안쪽에서 루이샤 씨가 뛰쳐나왔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8d590f85627a6468dfa6957afb1fb005ac7705b792309a42b2459ff6a9c5e216:000002_6484776551317863208:g0:r20",
      "row_index_0based": 20,
      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "密猟者から逃げようとしていた時、\n茂みの奥から今度はルイシャさんが飛び出してきた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4eec284b26f462738cf059fca03406e31b7554d2e86729ab2216e47fd898fd46",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "愛らしく素晴らしい主君に、危ないものを向けないで。\n見逃してあげるから……おとなしく島から出なさい。",
      "jp_sha256": "b7855c447381ea3f1170b2e6b30a0ad642cef13a2bdf484996154b5a7f261274",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "사랑스럽고 훌륭한 주군께 위험한 걸 겨누지 마세요.\n놓아줄 테니…… 얌전히 섬에서 나가세요.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 26,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8d590f85627a6468dfa6957afb1fb005ac7705b792309a42b2459ff6a9c5e216:000002_6484776551317863208:g0:r25",
      "row_index_0based": 25,
      "serialized_row_index": 25,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ルイシャ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_右中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "愛らしく素晴らしい主君に、危ないものを向けないで。\n見逃してあげるから……おとなしく島から出なさい。",
        "",
        "ch_10307/R18/10307A0_10307_Nml/10307A0_10307_002",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ルイシャ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10307/R18/10307A0_10307_Nml/10307A0_10307_002"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "53409269e4f24601debbe3ddc70b36eeac250656f49c20c0274901a1bb7e2ef2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "う、うぅ……ほんとか？　ほんとに見逃してくれるのか？\n背中を向けた瞬間、後ろからバッサリなんてこと――。",
      "jp_sha256": "09b9c6795ef4c882c8710752173438ba8ee18badfdef0eb1560b2992ae7f6a68",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "으, 으으…… 진짜냐? 정말 놓아주는 거냐?\n등을 돌리는 순간 뒤에서 싹둑 잘라 버리는 건――.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 27,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8d590f85627a6468dfa6957afb1fb005ac7705b792309a42b2459ff6a9c5e216:000002_6484776551317863208:g0:r26",
      "row_index_0based": 26,
      "serialized_row_index": 26,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "密猟者",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "う、うぅ……ほんとか？　ほんとに見逃してくれるのか？\n背中を向けた瞬間、後ろからバッサリなんてこと――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "密猟者",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "478873e96fe9712034aa1e0453972bf6ffda58113199d67e7ea660ac87170edb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "安心して、そんな卑怯なことはしない。\nおとなしく島を出ていくなら、それが１番良いもの。",
      "jp_sha256": "759c8f9c38da4722f87be216b26f6db1de1be8527d6d97eb41c0b6439d3c9da1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "안심하세요, 그런 비겁한 짓은 하지 않아요.\n얌전히 섬을 나간다면 그게 가장 좋으니까요.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 28,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
